flowchart LR
    DB[(Authoritative domain records)] --> O[Transactional outbox]
    O --> D[Versioned domain events]
    A[Android and web] -->|Validated bounded product events| I[First-party ingestion]
    I --> Q[Analytics event store or queue]
    D --> R[Reporting projector]
    Q --> R
    R --> M[(Versioned metric projections)]
    M --> B[Merchant and platform dashboards]
    DB --> V[Reconciliation and quality checks]
    M --> V
    V -->|Drift or missing data| X[Quarantine, alert and rebuild]
    A -. analytics failure never blocks .-> DB
